QUAN TR\uc0\u7884 NG
\f1\b0 : Tr\uc0\u432 \u7899 c khi g\u7917 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  th\'f4ng tin n\'e0o cho Apple b\u7857 ng vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng H\u7895  Tr\u7907  \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i, vui l\'f2ng xem c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin quan tr\u7885 ng v\'e0 tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n b\'ean d\u432 \u7899 i.\
\
H\uc0\u7895  Tr\u7907  \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i l\'e0 m\u7897 t c\'f4ng c\u7909  ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m d\'f9ng \u273 \u7875  thu th\u7853 p c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin m\'f4 t\u7843  c\'e1c v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  b\u7841 n g\u7863 p ph\u7843 i khi s\u7917  d\u7909 ng iOS, macOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, visionOS, ho\u7863 c c\'e1c s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m kh\'e1c mang th\u432 \u417 ng hi\u7879 u Apple, tu\u7923  t\u7915 ng tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p \'e1p d\u7909 ng. C\'f4ng c\u7909  n\'e0y s\u7869  t\u7853 p h\u7907 p c\'e1c nh\u7853 t k\'fd t\u7915  s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh c\u7911 a b\u7841 n c\'f3 ch\u7913 a c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin c\'e1 nh\'e2n, ch\u7859 ng h\u7841 n nh\u432  t\'ean, ID ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng, k\u7871 t n\u7889 i m\u7841 ng, \u273 \u7883 a \u273 i\u7875 m, d\u7919  li\u7879 u l\u7883 ch, v\'e0 th\u432  \u273 i\u7879 n t\u7917 . Nh\u7853 t k\'fd k\u7871 t n\u7889 i m\u7841 ng c\'f3 th\u7875  ch\u7913 a si\'eau d\u7919  li\u7879 u c\u7911 a k\u7871 t n\u7889 i m\u7841 ng kh\'f4ng d\'e2y c\u7911 a b\u7841 n, ch\u7859 ng h\u7841 n nh\u432  \u273 \u7883 a ch\u7881  ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng c\u7911 a b\u7897  \u273 \u7883 nh tuy\u7871 n kh\'f4ng d\'e2y m\'e0 b\u7841 n k\u7871 t n\u7889 i, t\'ean mi\u7873 n m\'e0 thi\u7871 t b\u7883  b\u7841 n truy c\u7853 p, \u273 \u7883 a ch\u7881  IP, v\'e0 c\'e1c ti\'eau \u273 \u7873  TCP/UDP, tu\u7923  t\u7915 ng tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p \'e1p d\u7909 ng. B\u7841 n c\'f3 th\u7875  xem, ch\u7881 nh s\u7917 a ho\u7863 c x\'f3a c\'e1c nh\u7853 t k\'fd n\'e0y tr\u432 \u7899 c ho\u7863 c sau khi b\u7841 n g\u7917 i ch\'fang cho Apple. B\u7841 n c\u361 ng c\'f3 th\u7875  cung c\u7845 p \'fd ki\u7871 n ph\u7843 n h\u7891 i b\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n.\
\
N\uc0\u7871 u b\u7841 n ch\u7885 n g\u7917 i th\'f4ng tin n\'e0y th\'f4ng qua H\u7895  Tr\u7907  \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i, b\u7841 n \u273 \'e3 \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng th\'f4ng tin \u273 \'f3 cho vi\u7879 c c\u7843 i thi\u7879 n c\'e1c s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m v\'e0 d\u7883 ch v\u7909  c\u7911 a Apple. \
\
************\
\

\f0\b APPLE INC.\
TH\uc0\u7886 A THU\u7852 N B\u7842 O M\u7852 T V\'c0 C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M CHO C\'d4NG C\u7908  H\u7894  TR\u7906  PH\u7842 N H\u7890 I \

\f1\b0 \
XIN VUI L\'d2NG \uc0\u272 \u7884 C K\u7928  TH\u7886 A THU\u7852 N B\u7842 O M\u7852 T V\'c0 C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M N\'c0Y (\'93THO\u7842  THU\u7852 N C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N\'94) TR\u431 \u7898 C KHI S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE. B\u7856 NG VI\u7878 C S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE, B\u7840 N \u272 \u7890 NG \'dd TU\'c2N TH\u7910  C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N TRONG THO\u7842  THU\u7852 N C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N N\'c0Y. N\u7870 U B\u7840 N TRUY C\u7852 P PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M B\u7856 NG PH\u431 \u416 NG TH\u7912 C \u272 I\u7878 N T\u7916 , VUI L\'d2NG NH\u7844 N HO\u7862 C CLICK N\'daT\'93\u272 \u7890 NG \'dd/CH\u7844 P NH\u7852 N\'94 \u272 \u7874  X\'c1C NH\u7852 N B\u7840 N S\u7868  TU\'c2N TH\u7910  C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N C\u7910 A THO\u7842  THU\u7852 N C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N N\'c0Y. N\u7870 U B\u7840 N KH\'d4NG \u272 \u7890 NG \'dd V\u7898 I C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N C\u7910 A THO\u7842  THU\u7852 N C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N N\'c0Y V\'c0 KH\'d4NG \u272 \u7890 NG \'dd V\u7898 I VI\u7878 C THU TH\u7852 P D\u7918  LI\u7878 U, VUI L\'d2NG KH\'d4NG S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M V\'c0 NH\u7844 N HO\u7862 C CLICK N\'daT \'93KH\'d4NG \u272 \u7890 NG \'dd/T\u7914  CH\u7888 I\'94 V\'c0 VUI L\'d2NG KH\'d4NG S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M \u272 \u7874  G\u7916 I C\'c1C NH\u7852 T K\'dd HAY C\'c1C TH\'d4NG TIN KH\'c1C CHO APPLE. \
\

\f0\b 1. \uc0\u272 i\u7873 u Kho\u7843 n Chung. \

\f1\b0 A. Ph\uc0\u7847 n m\u7873 m, t\'e0i li\u7879 u, c\'e1c giao di\u7879 n, n\u7897 i dung v\'e0 b\u7845 t k\u7923  ph\'f4ng ch\u7919  n\'e0o k\'e8m theo Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y c\u7911 a Apple v\'e0 c\u7911 a b\u7845 t k\u7923  b\'ean th\u7913  ba n\'e0o, d\'f9 \u7903  tr\'ean \u273 \u297 a, trong b\u7897  nh\u7899  ch\u7881  \u273 \u7885 c, tr\'ean b\u7845 t k\u7923  ph\u432 \u417 ng ti\u7879 n truy\u7873 n th\'f4ng n\'e0o ho\u7863 c d\u432 \u7899 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  d\u7841 ng th\u7913 c n\'e0o kh\'e1c (\u273 \u432 \u7907 c g\u7885 i chung l\'e0 \'93Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple\'94), \u273 \u432 \u7907 c Apple Inc. (\'93Apple\'94) c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng m\'e0 kh\'f4ng b\'e1n cho b\u7841 n, v\'e0 ch\u7881  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng theo c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y. Apple v\'e0/ho\u7863 c (c\'e1c) b\'ean c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n c\u7911 a Apple v\u7851 n gi\u7919  quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 b\u7843 o l\u432 u t\u7845 t c\u7843  c\'e1c quy\u7873 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p cho b\u7841 n m\u7897 t c\'e1ch r\'f5 r\'e0ng. C\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh b\u7845 t k\u7923  b\u7843 n n\'e2ng c\u7845 p ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m n\'e0o do Apple cung c\u7845 p \u273 \u7875  thay th\u7871  v\'e0/ho\u7863 c b\u7893  sung cho s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple nguy\'ean b\u7843 n, tr\u7915  tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p b\u7843 n n\'e2ng c\u7845 p \u273 \'f3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p k\'e8m theo m\u7897 t gi\u7845 y ph\'e9p ri\'eang th\'ec c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7911 a gi\u7845 y ph\'e9p ri\'eang \u273 \'f3 s\u7869  \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh b\u7843 n n\'e2ng c\u7845 p \u273 \'f3.\
\
B. Quy\uc0\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u v\'e0 c\'e1c quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u tr\'ed tu\u7879  trong v\'e0 \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  n\u7897 i dung n\'e0o \u273 \u432 \u7907 c hi\u7875 n th\u7883  ho\u7863 c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c truy c\u7853 p th\'f4ng qua Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u7873 u thu\u7897 c v\u7873  ch\u7911  s\u7903  h\u7919 u n\u7897 i dung t\u432 \u417 ng \u7913 ng. N\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3 c\'f3 th\u7875  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c b\u7843 o v\u7879  theo c\'e1c quy \u273 \u7883 nh ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t v\'e0 c\'e1c hi\u7879 p \u273 \u7883 nh kh\'e1c v\u7873  b\u7843 n quy\u7873 n ho\u7863 c quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u tr\'ed tu\u7879  kh\'e1c, v\'e0 c\'f3 th\u7875  ph\u7843 i tu\'e2n theo c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\u7911 a b\'ean th\u7913  ba cung c\u7845 p n\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3. Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y kh\'f4ng c\u7845 p cho b\u7841 n b\u7845 t k\u7923  quy\u7873 n n\'e0o \u273 \u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng n\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3 v\'e0 c\u361 ng kh\'f4ng b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m r\u7857 ng n\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3 s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ti\u7871 p t\u7909 c cung c\u7845 p cho b\u7841 n.\
\

\f0\b 2. Ph\uc0\u7841 m Vi S\u7917  D\u7909 ng \u272 \u432 \u7907 c Ph\'e9p v\'e0 C\'e1c H\u7841 n Ch\u7871 .\

\f1\b0 A. \ul C\uc0\u7845 p quy\u7873 n\ulnone . C\uc0\u259 n c\u7913  v\'e0o c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n v\'e0 \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y, b\u7841 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n h\u7841 n ch\u7871 , kh\'f4ng \u273 \u7897 c quy\u7873 n \u273 \u7875  c\'e0i \u273 \u7863 t v\'e0 s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple tr\'ean c\'e1c s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m mang th\u432 \u417 ng hi\u7879 u Apple t\u432 \u417 ng th\'edch m\'e0 b\u7841 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u ho\u7863 c ki\u7875 m so\'e1t trong th\u7901 i h\u7841 n c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y nh\u7857 m m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch cung c\u7845 p cho Apple c\'e1c nh\u7853 t k\'fd chu\u7849 n \u273 o\'e1n, k\u7929  thu\u7853 t, s\u7917  d\u7909 ng v\'e0 li\'ean quan v\'e0 c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin v\u7873  m\'e1y t\'ednh, thi\u7871 t b\u7883 , ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng, h\u7879  th\u7889 ng v\'e0 ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m \u7913 ng d\u7909 ng, v\'e0 c\'e1c thi\u7871 t b\u7883  ngo\u7841 i vi (\'93H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng C\u7911 a B\u7841 n\'94) c\'f3 li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n v\u7899 i (i) s\u7921  tham gia c\u7911 a b\u7841 n v\'e0o Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng Kh\'e1ch H\'e0ng c\u7911 a Apple, ch\u432 \u417 ng tr\'ecnh Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Beta Apple, v\'e0/ho\u7863 c Apple Developer Program (Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh Nh\'e0 Ph\'e1t Tri\u7875 n Apple) (g\u7885 i chung l\'e0 \'93Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng\'94) nh\u432  l\'e0 m\u7897 t ph\u7847 n \u273 \u7875  b\u7841 n \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 v\u7873  c\'e1ch th\u7913 c ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng v\'e0/ho\u7863 c ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m ph\'e1t h\'e0nh tr\u432 \u7899 c c\u7911 a Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p cho b\u7841 n theo Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng ho\u7841 t \u273 \u7897 ng tr\'ean H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng C\u7911 a B\u7841 n ho\u7863 c (ii) s\u7921  ho\'e0n tr\u7843  hay thay th\u7871  m\'e1y t\'ednh, thi\u7871 t b\u7883 , ho\u7863 c ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng c\u7911 a b\u7841 n cho Apple. B\u7841 n ch\u7881  c\'f3 th\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple n\'e0y (x) n\u7871 u b\u7841 n l\'e0 m\u7897 t th\'e0nh vi\'ean c\u7911 a Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng, (y) c\'f3 li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n vi\u7879 c ho\'e0n tr\u7843  hay thay th\u7871  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ph\'e9p c\u7911 a m\u7897 t s\u7889  s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m Apple, ho\u7863 c (z) theo c\'e1ch th\u7913 c kh\'e1c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c Apple cho ph\'e9p theo to\'e0n quy\u7873 n quy\u7871 t \u273 \u7883 nh c\u7911 a Apple. B\u7841 n ch\u7881  c\'f3 th\u7875  t\u7841 o ra nhi\u7873 u b\u7843 n sao Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng n\u7897 i b\u7897  khi c\u7847 n thi\u7871 t m\u7897 t c\'e1ch h\u7907 p l\'fd \u273 \u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng theo quy \u273 \u7883 nh t\u7841 i Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y; v\u7899 i \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n l\'e0 b\u7841 n t\u7841 o l\u7841 i tr\'ean m\u7895 i b\u7843 n sao c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple ho\u7863 c m\u7897 t ph\u7847 n c\u7911 a m\u7895 i b\u7843 n sao c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple t\u7845 t c\u7843  th\'f4ng b\'e1o v\u7873  b\u7843 n quy\u7873 n v\'e0 quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u tr\'ed tu\u7879  kh\'e1c ch\u7913 a trong b\u7843 n g\u7889 c. Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y kh\'f4ng c\u7845 p cho b\u7841 n quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple cho b\u7845 t k\u7923  m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch n\'e0o kh\'e1c, v\'e0 b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 \u432 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple l\'ean m\'f4i tr\u432 \u7901 ng m\u7841 ng n\u417 i nhi\u7873 u thi\u7871 t b\u7883  ho\u7863 c m\'e1y t\'ednh c\'f3 th\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple c\'f9ng m\u7897 t l\'fac. Tr\u7915  khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c quy \u273 \u7883 nh r\'f5 r\'e0ng trong Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y, kh\'f4ng quy\u7873 n n\'e0o kh\'e1c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p ho\u7863 c vi\u7879 c c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0o kh\'e1c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n ho\u7863 c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ng\u7909  \'fd c\u7845 p ho\u7863 c th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  t\'e0i s\u7843 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u tr\'ed tu\u7879  n\'e0o c\u7911 a Apple. \
\
B. \ul C\uc0\u7845 m Th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n K\u7929  thu\u7853 t \u272 \u7843 o ng\u432 \u7907 c; C\'e1c Gi\u7899 i H\u7841 n Kh\'e1c V\u7873  S\u7917  D\u7909 ng\ulnone . B\uc0\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n v\'e0 \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd kh\'f4ng th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n ho\u7863 c cho ph\'e9p ng\u432 \u7901 i kh\'e1c th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n nh\u7919 ng vi\u7879 c sau: sao ch\'e9p (tr\u7915  khi Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y cho ph\'e9p m\u7897 t c\'e1ch r\'f5 r\'e0ng), d\u7883 ch ng\u432 \u7907 c, thi\u7871 t k\u7871  \u273 \u7843 o ng\u432 \u7907 c, t\'e1ch r\u7901 i, t\'ecm c\'e1ch l\u7845 y m\'e3 ngu\u7891 n, gi\u7843 i m\'e3, s\u7917 a \u273 \u7893 i ho\u7863 c t\u7841 o s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m ph\'e1i sinh t\u7915  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, hay b\u7845 t k\u7923  ph\u7847 n n\'e0o c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple (tr\u7915  tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p v\'e0 ch\u7881  trong ph\u7841 m vi b\u7845 t k\u7923  quy \u273 \u7883 nh h\u7841 n ch\u7871  n\'e0o n\'eau tr\'ean b\u7883  nghi\'eam c\u7845 m theo lu\u7853 t hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh ho\u7863 c trong tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ph\'e9p theo c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7845 p ph\'e9p quy \u273 \u7883 nh vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\'e1c th\'e0nh ph\u7847 n ngu\u7891 n m\u7903  c\'f3 trong Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple), ho\u7863 c \u273 \u7875  t\'edch h\u7907 p v\'e0o hay ch\u7881 nh s\u7917 a ng\'f4n ng\u7919  l\u7853 p tr\'ecnh \u273 \u7875  t\u432 \u417 ng th\'edch v\u7899 i c\'e1c ch\u432 \u417 ng tr\'ecnh c\u7911 a ri\'eang b\u7841 n. B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple tu\'e2n theo t\u7845 t c\u7843  c\'e1c quy \u273 \u7883 nh c\u7911 a lu\u7853 t \'e1p d\u7909 ng, bao g\u7891 m ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a qu\u7889 c gia ho\u7863 c khu v\u7921 c n\u417 i b\u7841 n c\u432  tr\'fa ho\u7863 c n\u417 i b\u7841 n t\u7843 i v\u7873  ho\u7863 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple.\
\

\f0\b 3. Chuy\uc0\u7875 n Giao
\f1\b0 . B\uc0\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c thu\'ea, cho thu\'ea, cho m\u432 \u7907 n, c\u7845 p l\u7841 i quy\u7873 n, b\'e1n, chuy\u7875 n giao ho\u7863 c b\u7857 ng h\'ecnh th\u7913 c kh\'e1c ph\'e2n ph\u7889 i l\u7841 i ho\u7863 c c\u7845 p l\u7841 i quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple.\
\

\f0\b 4. Kh\'f4ng H\uc0\u7895  Tr\u7907  v\'e0 B\u7843 o Tr\'ec
\f1\b0 . Apple kh\'f4ng c\'f3 ngh\uc0\u297 a v\u7909  cung c\u7845 p d\u7883 ch v\u7909  b\u7843 o tr\'ec, h\u7895  tr\u7907  k\u7929  thu\u7853 t ho\u7863 c h\u7895  tr\u7907  n\'e0o kh\'e1c cho Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, ho\u7863 c b\u7845 t k\u7923  c\u7853 p nh\u7853 t n\'e0o cho b\u7841 n \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple. \

\f0\b \
5. Ch\uc0\u7845 p Thu\u7853 n Vi\u7879 c Thu Th\u7853 p v\'e0 S\u7917  D\u7909 ng D\u7919  Li\u7879 u.\

\f1\b0 A. \ul D\uc0\u7919  li\u7879 u ph\'e2n t\'edch cho \u7913 ng d\u7909 ng H\u7895  Tr\u7907  Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i\ulnone . N\uc0\u7871 u b\u7841 n l\u7921 a ch\u7885 n cho ph\'e9p vi\u7879 c thu th\u7853 p D\u7919  li\u7879 u ph\'e2n t\'edch cho Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple (\u7912 ng D\u7909 ng H\u7895  Tr\u7907  \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i), b\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Apple, c\'e1c c\'f4ng ty con v\'e0 c\'e1c \u273 \u7841 i l\'fd c\u7911 a Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  thu th\u7853 p, l\u432 u gi\u7919 , x\u7917  l\'fd v\'e0 s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin ch\u7849 n \u273 o\'e1n, th\'f4ng tin k\u7929  thu\u7853 t, th\'f4ng tin v\u7873  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng v\'e0 c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin li\'ean quan, bao g\u7891 m nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u7903  c\'e1c m\'e3 \u273 \u7883 nh danh ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng ho\u7863 c h\u7879  th\u7889 ng ri\'eang, th\'f4ng tin v\u7873  thi\u7871 t b\u7883 , m\'e1y t\'ednh, h\u7879  th\u7889 ng v\'e0 ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m \u7913 ng d\u7909 ng, v\'e0 c\'e1c thi\u7871 t b\u7883  ngo\u7841 i vi c\u7911 a b\u7841 n, v\'e0 c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin n\'e0y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c thu th\u7853 p \u273 \u7883 nh k\u7923  \u273 \u7875  cung c\u7845 p v\'e0 c\u7843 i thi\u7879 n c\'e1c s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m v\'e0 d\u7883 ch v\u7909  c\u7911 a Apple, t\u7841 o \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n thu\u7853 n l\u7907 i cho vi\u7879 c cung c\u7845 p cho b\u7841 n c\'e1c c\u7853 p nh\u7853 t ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m, h\u7895  tr\u7907  s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m v\'e0 c\'e1c d\u7883 ch v\u7909  kh\'e1c (n\u7871 u c\'f3) li\'ean quan t\u7899 i Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, v\'e0 \u273 \u7875  ki\u7875 m tra vi\u7879 c tu\'e2n th\u7911  c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y. Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng th\'f4ng tin n\'e0y cho c\'e1c m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch n\'eau tr\'ean, mi\u7877 n l\'e0 th\'f4ng tin \u273 \u432 \u7907 c thu th\u7853 p \u7903  d\u7841 ng kh\'f4ng \u273 \u7883 nh danh c\'e1 nh\'e2n b\u7841 n. \u272 \u7875  cho ph\'e9p c\'e1c \u273 \u7889 i t\'e1c c\u7911 a Apple v\'e0 b\'ean thi\u7871 t k\u7871  th\u7913  ba c\u7843 i thi\u7879 n ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m, ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng, v\'e0 d\u7883 ch v\u7909  c\u7911 a h\u7885  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c thi\u7871 t k\u7871  \u273 \u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng v\u7899 i c\'e1c s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m Apple, Apple c\u361 ng c\'f3 th\u7875  cung c\u7845 p cho \u273 \u7889 i t\'e1c ho\u7863 c b\'ean ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n th\u7913  ba \u273 \'f3 m\u7897 t ph\u7847 n th\'f4ng tin ch\u7849 n \u273 o\'e1n c\'f3 li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m, ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng, v\'e0/ho\u7863 c c\'e1c d\u7883 ch v\u7909  c\u7911 a \u273 \u7889 i t\'e1c ho\u7863 c b\'ean ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n \u273 \'f3 v\u7899 i \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n l\'e0 th\'f4ng tin ch\u7849 n \u273 o\'e1n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p \u7903  d\u7841 ng kh\'f4ng \u273 \u7883 nh danh c\'e1 nh\'e2n b\u7841 n. \u8232 \
B. \ul Nh\uc0\u7853 t K\'fd Chi Ti\u7871 t \u273 \u432 \u7907 c g\u7917 i cho Apple\ulnone . Th\'f4ng qua vi\uc0\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple n\'e0y, b\u7841 n s\u7869  c\'f3 t\'f9y ch\u7885 n th\'f4ng tin \u273 \'ednh k\'e8m t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng t\u7915  H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng C\u7911 a B\u7841 n, bao g\u7891 m nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n c\'e1c b\'e1o c\'e1o H\u7891  S\u417  H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng Apple, c\'e1c crash log, nh\u7853 t k\'fd xoay, nh\u7853 t k\'fd treo, nh\u7853 t k\'fd c\'e0i \u273 \u7863 t, nh\u7853 t k\'fd kernel panic, v\'e0 c\'e1c nh\u7853 t k\'fd to\'e0n b\u7897  h\u7879  th\u7889 ng (\'93Nh\u7853 t K\'fd Chi Ti\u7871 t\'94). N\u7871 u b\u7841 n ch\u7885 n g\u7917 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  Nh\u7853 t K\'fd Chi Ti\u7871 t n\'e0o cho Apple b\u7857 ng c\'e1ch s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, khi \u273 \'f3 t\'ean v\'e0 \u273 \u7883 a ch\u7881  email c\u7911 a b\u7841 n s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 \u432 a v\'e0o trong n\u7897 i dung g\u7917 i c\u7911 a b\u7841 n v\'e0 c\'e1c nh\u7853 t k\'fd m\'e0 b\u7841 n \u273 \'ednh k\'e8m c\'f3 th\u7875  ch\u7913 a \u273 \u7921 ng c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin nh\u7853 n d\u7841 ng c\'e1 nh\'e2n, bao g\u7891 m, nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n, t\'ean t\'e0i kho\u7843 n c\u7911 a b\u7841 n, th\'f4ng tin v\u7873  c\'e1c li\'ean l\u7841 c, c\'e1c s\u7921  ki\u7879 n l\u7883 ch, v\'e0 th\u432  \u273 i\u7879 n t\u7917  c\u7911 a b\u7841 n. Vi\u7879 c cung c\u7845 p nh\u7919 ng Nh\u7853 t K\'fd Chi Ti\u7871 t n\'e0y l\'e0 t\u7921  nguy\u7879 n, nh\u432 ng trong ph\u7841 m vi b\u7841 n ch\u7885 n cung c\u7845 p ch\'fang, b\u7841 n x\'e1c nh\u7853 n v\'e0 \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Nh\u7853 t K\'fd Chi Ti\u7871 t \u273 \'f3 cho c\'e1c m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch ch\u7849 n \u273 o\'e1n v\'e0 cho c\'e1c c\u7843 i ti\u7871 n s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m v\'e0 d\u7883 ch v\u7909 . Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  l\u432 u gi\u7919  Nh\u7853 t K\'fd Chi Ti\u7871 t n\'e0y cho \u273 \u7871 n khi l\u7895 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c kh\u7855 c ph\u7909 c.\
\
C. \ul C\'e1c Thu\uc0\u7897 c T\'ednh H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng g\u7917 i cho Apple\ulnone . Ngo\'e0i ra, Ph\uc0\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  c\'f3 m\u7897 t t\'ednh n\u259 ng t\u7893 ng h\u7907 p danh s\'e1ch m\u7897 t s\u7889  \u7913 ng d\u7909 ng ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m, c\'e1c t\'ednh n\u259 ng v\'e0 ch\u7913 c n\u259 ng t\u7915  H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng C\u7911 a B\u7841 n c\u361 ng nh\u432  th\'f4ng tin v\u7873  vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\'e1c \u7913 ng d\u7909 ng, t\'ednh n\u259 ng v\'e0 ch\u7913 c n\u259 ng \u273 \'f3 (\'93C\'e1c Thu\u7897 c T\'ednh\'94). Danh s\'e1ch n\'e0y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c g\u7917 i cho Apple tr\u7915  khi b\u7841 n ch\u7885 n g\u7917 i ch\'fang. N\u7871 u t\'ednh n\u259 ng n\'e0y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p, khi \u273 \'f3 Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple cung c\u7845 p m\u7897 t danh s\'e1ch C\'e1c Thu\u7897 c T\'ednh \u273 \u432 \u7907 c thu th\u7853 p v\'e0 cho ph\'e9p b\u7841 n lo\u7841 i b\u7887  b\u7845 t k\u7923  Thu\u7897 c T\'ednh c\u7909  th\u7875  n\'e0o tr\u432 \u7899 c khi g\u7917 i cho Apple. Vi\u7879 c cung c\u7845 p C\'e1c Thu\u7897 c T\'ednh cho Apple l\'e0 t\u7921  nguy\u7879 n, nh\u432 ng trong ph\u7841 m vi b\u7841 n ch\u7885 n cung c\u7845 p ch\'fang, b\u7841 n x\'e1c nh\u7853 n v\'e0 \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng \u273 \u7875  C\'e1c Thu\u7897 c T\'ednh \u273 \'f3 \u273 \u7875  c\u7843 i thi\u7879 n Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng v\'e0 cho c\'e1c c\u7843 i ti\u7871 n s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m v\'e0 d\u7883 ch v\u7909 . Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  l\u432 u gi\u7919  C\'e1c Thu\u7897 c T\'ednh n\'e0y cho \u273 \u7871 n khi l\u7895 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c kh\u7855 c ph\u7909 c. \
\
D. \ul Ch\'ednh S\'e1ch Quy\uc0\u7873 n Ri\'eang T\u432 \ulnone . V\'e0o m\uc0\u7885 i th\u7901 i \u273 i\u7875 m, th\'f4ng tin c\u7911 a b\u7841 n s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c x\u7917  l\'fd theo Ch\'ednh S\'e1ch Quy\u7873 n Ri\'eang T\u432  c\u7911 a Apple, c\'f3 t\u7841 i: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/"}}{\fldrslt https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/}}.\

\f0\b \
6. B\uc0\u7843 o M\u7853 t.\

\f1\b0 A. B\uc0\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n d\u432 \u7899 i \u273 \'e2y v\'e0 t\u7845 t c\u7843  th\'f4ng tin Apple c\'f4ng b\u7889  cho b\u7841 n li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \'f3 s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c xem v\'e0 g\u7885 i chung l\'e0 \'93Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t\'94. Tuy nhi\'ean, Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t kh\'f4ng bao g\u7891 m: (a) th\'f4ng tin hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i ho\u7863 c sau n\'e0y tr\u7903  n\'ean ph\u7893  bi\u7871 n trong c\'f4ng ch\'fang kh\'f4ng ph\u7843 i do l\u7895 i ho\u7863 c vi ph\u7841 m t\u7915  ph\'eda b\u7841 n m\'e0 theo quy \u273 \u7883 nh c\u7911 a ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t ho\u7863 c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n b\u7903 i Apple; (b) th\'f4ng tin m\'e0 b\u7841 n c\'f3 th\u7875  ch\u7913 ng minh l\'e0 \u273 \'e3 thu\u7897 c quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u ch\'ednh \u273 \'e1ng c\u7911 a b\u7841 n tr\u432 \u7899 c khi Apple ti\u7871 t l\u7897  cho b\u7841 n; (c) th\'f4ng tin \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n \u273 \u7897 c l\u7853 p b\u7903 i b\u7841 n m\'e0 kh\'f4ng s\u7917  d\u7909 ng b\u7845 t k\u7923  Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t n\'e0o; ho\u7863 c (d) th\'f4ng tin m\'e0 b\u7841 n c\'f3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c m\u7897 t c\'e1ch h\u7907 p ph\'e1p t\u7915  m\u7897 t b\'ean th\u7913  ba m\'e0 Apple trao quy\u7873 n chuy\u7875 n nh\u432 \u7907 ng hay ti\u7871 t l\u7897  th\'f4ng tin \u273 \'f3. \
\
B. B\uc0\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd kh\'f4ng ti\u7871 t l\u7897 , c\'f4ng b\u7889 , ho\u7863 c ph\u7893  bi\u7871 n Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t cho b\u7845 t k\u7923  ai kh\'e1c ngo\'e0i: (1) c\'e1c nh\'e2n vi\'ean v\'e0 nh\'e0 th\u7847 u c\u7911 a b\u7841 n c\'f3 nhu c\u7847 u r\'f5 r\'e0ng c\u7847 n ph\u7843 i bi\u7871 t v\'e0n h\u7919 ng ng\u432 \u7901 i n\'e0y c\'f3 ngh\u297 a v\u7909  tu\'e2n th\u7911  b\u7843 o m\u7853 t, b\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n, \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7841 n \u273 \u7875  b\u7843 o v\u7879  Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t \u273 \'f3 kh\'f4ng b\u7883  ti\u7871 t l\u7897  tr\'e1i ph\'e9p, ho\u7863 c (2) nh\u7919 ng ng\u432 \u7901 i tham gia kh\'e1c v\'e0o Ch\u432 \u417 ng Tr\'ecnh H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng c\u7911 a Apple, nh\u432 ng ch\u7881  th\'f4ng qua vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\'e1c di\u7877 n \u273 \'e0n th\u7843 o lu\u7853 n b\u7843 o m\u7853 t cho Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple do Apple cung c\u7845 p th\'f4ng qua c\u7893 ng th\'f4ng tin m\u7841 ng H\u7841 t Gi\u7889 ng hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh (n\u7871 u c\'f3). Ngo\'e0i ra, B\u7841 n c\u361 ng \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n c\'e1c bi\u7879 n ph\'e1p ph\'f2ng ng\u7915 a h\u7907 p l\'fd \u273 \u7875  ng\u259 n ch\u7863 n m\u7885 i h\'e0nh vi s\u7917  d\u7909 ng, ti\u7871 t l\u7897 , xu\u7845 t b\u7843 n ho\u7863 c ph\u7893  bi\u7871 n tr\'e1i ph\'e9p Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t. B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd kh\'f4ng s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t v\'ec l\u7907 i \'edch c\u7911 a ch\'ednh b\u7841 n ho\u7863 c c\u7911 a b\u7845 t k\u7923  b\'ean th\u7913  ba n\'e0o m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\'f3 s\u7921  ch\u7845 p thu\u7853 n tr\u432 \u7899 c b\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n c\u7911 a ng\u432 \u7901 i \u273 \u7841 i di\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u7911 y quy\u7873 n c\u7911 a Apple trong t\u7915 ng tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p. T\u7845 t c\u7843  Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t v\u7851 n l\'e0 t\'e0i s\u7843 n \u273 \u7897 c quy\u7873 n c\u7911 a Apple. B\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n ho\u7863 c c\'f3 c\'e1c quy\u7873 n h\u7841 n kh\'e1c m\u7897 t c\'e1ch ng\u7909  \'fd \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t ch\u432 a \u273 \u432 \u7907 c quy \u273 \u7883 nh \u273 \u432 \u7907 c quy \u273 \u7883 nh c\u7909  th\u7875  trong Ph\u7847 n 2A.\
\
C. B\uc0\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n n\'e0y, b\u7841 n x\'e1c nh\u7853 n r\u7857 ng vi\u7879 c ti\u7871 t l\u7897  ho\u7863 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng tr\'e1i ph\'e9p Th\'f4ng Tin M\u7853 t c\'f3 th\u7875  g\'e2y ra thi\u7879 t h\u7841 i kh\'f4ng th\u7875  kh\u7855 c ph\u7909 c v\'e0 t\u7893 n th\u7845 t \u273 \'e1ng k\u7875  cho Apple m\'e0 c\'f3 th\u7875  kh\'f3 x\'e1c \u273 \u7883 nh. Theo \u273 \'f3, b\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng ngo\'e0i c\'e1c quy\u7873 n v\'e0 bi\u7879 n ph\'e1p kh\u7855 c ph\u7909 c n\'e0o kh\'e1c m\'e0 Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  c\'f3, Apple s\u7869  c\'f3 quy\u7873 n y\'eau c\u7847 u th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n bi\u7879 n ph\'e1p kh\u7849 n c\u7845 p t\u7841 m th\u7901 i \u273 \u7875  bu\u7897 c th\u7921 c thi c\'e1c ngh\u297 a v\u7909  b\u7843 o m\u7853 t theo Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y.\
\

\f0\b 7. Ch\uc0\u7845 m d\u7913 t.
\f1\b0  Tho\uc0\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  c\'f3 hi\u7879 u l\u7921 c cho \u273 \u7871 n khi ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t. Quy\u7873 n c\u7911 a b\u7841 n theo Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t ho\u7863 c h\u7871 t hi\u7879 u l\u7921 c d\u432 \u7899 i h\'ecnh th\u7913 c kh\'e1c m\'e0 Apple kh\'f4ng c\u7847 n ph\u7843 i th\'f4ng b\'e1o n\u7871 u b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng tu\'e2n th\u7911  b\u7845 t k\u7923  (c\'e1c) \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n n\'e0o c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y. Ngo\'e0i ra, Apple b\u7843 o l\u432 u quy\u7873 n ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y n\u7871 u m\u7897 t phi\'ean b\u7843 n m\u7899 i c\u7911 a ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m h\u7879  th\u7889 ng v\u7853 n h\'e0nh c\u7911 a Apple ho\u7863 c Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ph\'e1t h\'e0nh kh\'f4ng t\u432 \u417 ng th\'edch v\u7899 i phi\'ean b\u7843 n n\'e0y c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple. Khi Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t, b\u7841 n s\u7869  ph\u7843 i ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t ho\'e0n to\'e0n vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 h\u7911 y b\u7887  t\u7845 t c\u7843  c\'e1c b\u7843 n sao, d\'f9 l\'e0 to\'e0n b\u7897  hay m\u7897 t ph\u7847 n, c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple. Ph\u7847 n 2B, 5 (nh\u432 ng ch\u7881  trong ph\u7841 m vi thu th\u7853 p \u273 \u432 \u7907 c tr\u432 \u7899 c khi ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t), 6, 7, 8 (nh\u432 ng ch\u7881  trong ph\u7841 m vi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p tr\u432 \u7899 c khi ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t), 9, 10, 11, 12, 14, 15, v\'e0 16 c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  t\u7891 n t\u7841 i khi ch\u7845 m d\u7913 t quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng.\
\

\f0\b 8. \'dd Ki\uc0\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n h\u7891 i
\f1\b0 . Ph\uc0\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple s\u7869  \u273 \u7875  b\u7841 n c\'f3 c\u417  h\u7897 i g\u7917 i c\'e1c b\'e1o c\'e1o l\u7895 i, c\'e1c b\u7843 ng c\'e2u h\u7887 i, c\'e1c y\'eau c\u7847 u n\'e2ng cao, b\'e1o c\'e1o v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  v\'e0/ho\u7863 c th\'f4ng tin h\u7895  tr\u7907  (g\u7885 i chung l\'e0, \'93\'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i\'94) v\u7873  H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng C\u7911 a B\u7841 n ho\u7863 c Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple cho Apple. Tr\u7915  khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c quy \u273 \u7883 nh kh\'e1c trong Ph\u7847 n 5, b\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng n\u7871 u kh\'f4ng c\'f3 th\u7887 a thu\u7853 n ri\'eang b\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n n\'e0o quy \u273 \u7883 nh kh\'e1c \u273 i, Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c t\u7921  do s\u7917  d\u7909 ng b\u7845 t k\u7923  \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i n\'e0o \u273 \u432 \u7907 c b\u7841 n cung c\u7845 p cho b\u7845 t k\u7923  m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch n\'e0o. B\u7841 n c\u361 ng cam k\u7871 t v\u7899 i Apple r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n c\'f3 t\u7845 t c\u7843  quy\u7873 n c\u7847 n thi\u7871 t \u273 \u7875  \u273 \u432 a ra \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i v\'e0 c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n cho Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c x\u7917  l\'fd \'dd Ki\u7871 n Ph\u7843 n H\u7891 i \u273 \'f3.\
\

\f0\b 9. Tuy\'ean B\uc0\u7889  Mi\u7877 n tr\u7915  Ngh\u297 a v\u7909  \u272 \u7843 m B\u7843 o. \

\f1\b0 A. B\uc0\u7840 N X\'c1C NH\u7852 N V\'c0 \u272 \u7890 NG \'dd M\u7896 T C\'c1CH R\'d5 R\'c0NG R\u7856 NG, TRONG PH\u7840 M VI \u272 \u431 \u7906 C PH\'c1P LU\u7852 T HI\u7878 N H\'c0NH CHO PH\'c9P, B\u7840 N CH\u7882 U HO\'c0N TO\'c0N R\u7910 I RO CHO VI\u7878 C S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE V\'c0 TO\'c0N B\u7896  R\u7910 I RO V\u7872  M\u7912 C \u272 \u7896  H\'c0I L\'d2NG V\u7872  CH\u7844 T L\u431 \u7906 NG, HI\u7878 U SU\u7844 T, \u272 \u7896  CH\'cdNH X\'c1C V\'c0 C\'d4NG S\u7912 C B\u7886  RA. \
\
B. TRONG PH\uc0\u7840 M VI T\u7888 I \u272 A M\'c0 LU\u7852 T HI\u7878 N H\'c0NH CHO PH\'c9P, PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE \u272 \u431 \u7906 C CUNG C\u7844 P \'93THEO NGUY\'caN TR\u7840 NG\'94 V\'c0 \'93NH\u431  HI\u7878 N C\'d3\'94, V\u7898 I T\u7844 T C\u7842  C\'c1C L\u7894 I V\'c0 KH\'d4NG C\'d3 B\u7844 T K\u7922  S\u7920  \u272 \u7842 M B\u7842 O D\u431 \u7898 I B\u7844 T K\u7922  H\'ccNH TH\u7912 CN\'c0O. \u272 \u7890 NG TH\u7900 I, QUA \u272 \'c2Y, APPLE C\u360 NG NH\u431  C\'c1C B\'caN C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N S\u7916  D\u7908 NG C\u7910 A APPLE (G\u7884 I CHUNG L\'c0 \'93APPLE\'94 THEO M\u7908 C \u272 \'cdCH C\u7910 A \u272 I\u7872 U 9 V\'c0 10) TUY\'caN B\u7888  KH\'d4NG CH\u7882 U TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I M\u7884 I \u272 \u7842 M B\u7842 O V\'c0 \u272 I\u7872 U KI\u7878 N LI\'caN QUAN \u272 \u7870 N PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE, D\'d9 L\'c0 R\'d5 R\'c0NG, NG\u7846 M \u272 \u7882 NH HAY THEO QUY \u272 \u7882 NH, BAO G\u7890 M NH\u431 NG KH\'d4NG GI\u7898 I H\u7840 N \u7902  C\'c1C \u272 \u7842 M B\u7842 O V\'c0/HO\u7862 C \u272 I\u7872 U KI\u7878 N NG\u7846 M \u272 \u7882 NH V\u7872  KH\u7842  N\u258 NG TI\'caU TH\u7908 , CH\u7844 T L\u431 \u7906 NG TH\u7886 A \u272 \'c1NG, S\u7920  PH\'d9 H\u7906 P CHO M\u7896 T M\u7908 C \u272 \'cdCH C\u7908  TH\u7874 , \u272 \u7896  CH\'cdNH X\'c1C, KH\u7842  N\u258 NG S\u7916  D\u7908 NG KH\'d4NG G\'c2Y PHI\u7872 N TO\'c1I V\'c0 VI\u7878 C KH\'d4NG VI PH\u7840 M QUY\u7872 N C\u7910 A B\'caN TH\u7912  BA. \
\
C. APPLE KH\'d4NG B\uc0\u7842 O \u272 \u7842 M R\u7856 NG S\u7868  KH\'d4NG C\'d3 S\u7920  CAN THI\u7878 P V\'c0O QU\'c1 TR\'ccNH B\u7840 N S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE, R\u7856 NG C\'c1C CH\u7912 C N\u258 NG C\'d3 TRONG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE S\u7868  \u272 \'c1P \u7912 NG Y\'caU C\u7846 U C\u7910 A B\u7840 N, R\u7856 NG HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG C\u7910 A PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE S\u7868  KH\'d4NG B\u7882  GI\'c1N \u272 O\u7840 N HO\u7862 C KH\'d4NG C\'d3 L\u7894 I, R\u7856 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE S\u7868  T\u431 \u416 NG TH\'cdCH HO\u7862 C HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG V\u7898 I B\u7844 T K\u7922  PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M, \u7912 NG D\u7908 NG HO\u7862 C D\u7882 CH V\u7908  N\'c0O C\u7910 A B\'caN TH\u7912  BA HO\u7862 C R\u7856 NG C\'c1C KHI\u7870 M KHUY\u7870 T TRONG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE S\u7868  \u272 \u431 \u7906 C KH\u7854 C PH\u7908 C. VI\u7878 C C\'c0I \u272 \u7862 T PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE N\'c0Y C\'d3 TH\u7874  \u7842 NH H\u431 \u7902 NG T\u7898 I KH\u7842  N\u258 NG HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG V\'c0 S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M, \u7912 NG D\u7908 NG HO\u7862 C D\u7882 CH V\u7908  C\u7910 A B\'caN TH\u7912  BA, C\u360 NG NH\u431  C\'c1C S\u7842 N PH\u7848 M V\'c0 D\u7882 CH V\u7908  C\u7910 A APPLE. \
\
D. B\uc0\u7840 N X\'c1C NH\u7852 N TH\'caM R\u7856 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE KH\'d4NG \u272 \u431 \u7906 C T\u7840 O RA \u272 \u7874  S\u7916  D\u7908 NG HO\u7862 C KH\'d4NG PH\'d9 H\u7906 P \u272 \u7874  S\u7916  D\u7908 NG TRONG C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KI\u7878 N HO\u7862 C M\'d4I TR\u431 \u7900 NG M\'c0 TRONG \u272 \'d3, VI\u7878 C N\u7896 I DUNG, D\u7918  LI\u7878 U HO\u7862 C TH\'d4NG TIN DO PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE CUNG C\u7844 P B\u7882  SAI S\'d3T, CH\u7852 M TR\u7876 , C\'d3 L\u7894 I HAY KH\'d4NG CH\'cdNH X\'c1C C\'d3 TH\u7874  G\'c2Y T\u7916  VONG, TH\u431 \u416 NG T\u7852 T HO\u7862 C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I NGHI\'caM TR\u7884 NG V\u7872  V\u7852 T CH\u7844 T HO\u7862 C M\'d4I TR\u431 \u7900 NG, BAO G\u7890 M NH\u431 NG KH\'d4NG GI\u7898 I H\u7840 N \u7902  HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG C\u7910 A C\'c1C C\u416  S\u7902  H\u7840 T NH\'c2N, \u272 I\u7872 U KHI\u7874 N M\'c1Y BAY HO\u7862 C C\'c1C H\u7878  TH\u7888 NG TH\'d4NG TIN LI\'caN L\u7840 C, H\u7878  TH\u7888 NG KI\u7874 M SO\'c1T KH\'d4NG L\u431 U, C\u7912 U H\u7896  HO\u7862 C H\u7878  TH\u7888 NG V\u360  KH\'cd. \
\
E. KH\'d4NG C\'d3 B\uc0\u7844 T K\u7922  TH\'d4NG TIN HO\u7862 C T\u431  V\u7844 N N\'c0O B\u7856 NG V\u258 N B\u7842 N HO\u7862 C B\u7856 NG L\u7900 I N\'d3I C\u7910 A APPLE HO\u7862 C M\u7896 T \u272 \u7840 I \u272 I\u7878 N C\'d3 TH\u7848 M QUY\u7872 N C\u7910 A APPLE C\'d3 TH\u7874  T\u7840 O RA M\u7896 T S\u7920  \u272 \u7842 M B\u7842 O. N\u7870 U PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE B\u7882  L\u7894 I, B\u7840 N S\u7868  CH\u7882 U TO\'c0N B\u7896  CHI PH\'cd \u272 \u7874  TH\u7920 C HI\u7878 N VI\u7878 C B\u7842 O D\u431 \u7904 NG, S\u7916 A CH\u7918 A HO\u7862 C KH\'d4I PH\u7908 C C\u7846 N THI\u7870 T. M\u7896 T S\u7888  KHU V\u7920 C T\'c0I PH\'c1N KH\'d4NG CHO PH\'c9P LO\u7840 I TR\u7914  C\'c1C B\u7842 O \u272 \u7842 M NG\u7846 M \u272 \u7882 NH HO\u7862 C H\u7840 N CH\u7870  V\u7872  QUY\u7872 N C\u7910 A NG\u431 \u7900 I TI\'caU D\'d9NG THEO QUY \u272 \u7882 NH C\u7910 A LU\u7852 T \'c1P D\u7908 NG. V\'cc V\u7852 Y, C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N LO\u7840 I TR\u7914  V\'c0 H\u7840 N CH\u7870  TR\'caN C\'d3 TH\u7874  KH\'d4NG \'c1P D\u7908 NG CHO B\u7840 N. \
\

\f0\b 10. Gi\uc0\u7899 i H\u7841 n Tr\'e1ch Nhi\u7879 m Ph\'e1p L\'fd.
\f1\b0  TRONG PH\uc0\u7840 M VI LU\u7852 T HI\u7878 N H\'c0NH KH\'d4NG C\u7844 M, APPLE S\u7868  KH\'d4NG C\'d3 TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1P L\'dd TRONG B\u7844 T K\u7922  TR\u431 \u7900 NG H\u7906 P N\'c0O \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I TH\u431 \u416 NG T\u7852 T HO\u7862 C B\u7844 T K\u7922  THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I N\'c0O MANG T\'cdNH NG\u7850 U NHI\'caN, \u272 \u7862 C BI\u7878 T, GI\'c1N TI\u7870 P HO\u7862 C MANG T\'cdNH H\u7852 U QU\u7842 , BAO G\u7890 M NH\u431 NG KH\'d4NG GI\u7898 I H\u7840 N \u7902  C\'c1C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I DO T\u7892 N TH\u7844 T V\u7872  L\u7906 I NHU\u7852 N, H\u7886 NG HO\u7862 C M\u7844 T D\u7918  LI\u7878 U, KH\'d4NG TH\u7874  TRUY\u7872 N HO\u7862 C NH\u7852 N D\u7918  LI\u7878 U HAY TH\'d4NG TIN, S\u7920  C\u7888  GI\'c1N \u272 O\u7840 N KINH DOANH HO\u7862 C B\u7844 T K\u7922  THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I HAY T\u7892 N TH\u7844 T TH\u431 \u416 NG M\u7840 I N\'c0O KH\'c1C, PH\'c1T SINH T\u7914  HO\u7862 C LI\'caN QUAN \u272 \u7870 N VI\u7878 C B\u7840 N S\u7916  D\u7908 NG HO\u7862 C KH\'d4NG TH\u7874  S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE HAY PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M HO\u7862 C \u7912 NG D\u7908 NG C\u7910 A B\'caN TH\u7912  BA C\'d3 LI\'caN QUAN \u272 \u7870 N PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE, CHO D\'d9 THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I HAY T\u7892 N TH\u7844 T \u272 \'d3 B\u7854 T NGU\u7890 N T\u7914  NGUY\'caN NH\'c2N N\'c0O, B\u7844 T K\u7874  TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1T SINH THEO H\'ccNH TH\u7912 C N\'c0O (THEO H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG, DO VI PH\u7840 M D\'c2N S\u7920  HO\u7862 C THEO H\'ccNH TH\u7912 C KH\'c1C) V\'c0 NGAY C\u7842  KHI APPLE \u272 \'c3 \u272 \u431 \u7906 C KHUY\u7870 N C\'c1O V\u7872  KH\u7842  N\u258 NG X\u7842 Y RA C\'c1C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I \u272 \'d3. M\u7896 T S\u7888  KHU V\u7920 C T\'c0I PH\'c1N KH\'d4NG CHO PH\'c9P LO\u7840 I TR\u7914  HO\u7862 C H\u7840 N CH\u7870  TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1P L\'dd \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I TH\u431 \u416 NG T\u7852 T C\'c1 NH\'c2N, THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I NG\u7850 U NHI\'caN HAY C\'d3 T\'cdNH H\u7852 U QU\u7842 , V\'cc V\u7852 Y, H\u7840 N CH\u7870  N\'c0Y C\'d3 TH\u7874  KH\'d4NG \'c1P D\u7908 NG \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I B\u7840 N. Trong m\u7885 i tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p, t\u7893 ng tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m c\u7911 a Apple \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i c\'e1c thi\u7879 t h\u7841 i x\u7843 y ra v\u7899 i b\u7841 n (tr\u7915  tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p lu\u7853 t hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh c\'f3 quy \u273 \u7883 nh trong c\'e1c tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p li\'ean quan t\u7899 i th\u432 \u417 ng t\u7853 t) s\u7869  kh\'f4ng v\u432 \u7907 t qu\'e1 n\u259 m m\u432 \u417 i \u273 \'f4 la ($50,00). C\'e1c quy \u273 \u7883 nh gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n tr\'ean s\u7869  \'e1p d\u7909 ng ngay c\u7843  khi bi\u7879 n ph\'e1p kh\u7855 c ph\u7909 c n\'eau tr\'ean kh\'f4ng \u273 \u7841 t \u273 \u432 \u7907 c m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch ch\'ednh.\
\

\f0\b 11. Qu\uc0\u7843 n L\'fd Xu\u7845 t Kh\u7849 u
\f1\b0 . B\uc0\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng ho\u7863 c b\u7857 ng c\'e1ch n\'e0o kh\'e1c xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u ho\u7863 c t\'e1i xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple tr\u7915  khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cho ph\'e9p b\u7903 i lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a Hoa K\u7923  v\'e0 lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a (c\'e1c) qu\u7889 c gia n\u417 i Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c mua. C\u7909  th\u7875  l\'e0, nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng h\u7841 n ch\u7871 , kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u ho\u7863 c t\'e1i xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0o (a) b\u7845 t k\u7923  qu\u7889 c gia n\'e0o b\u7883  Hoa K\u7923  c\u7845 m v\u7853 n ho\u7863 c (b) b\u7845 t k\u7923  \u273 \u7889 i t\u432 \u7907 ng n\'e0o trong danh s\'e1ch C\'e1c \u272 \u7889 i T\u432 \u7907 ng B\u7883  \u272 \u7889 i X\u7917  \u272 \u7863 c Bi\u7879 t c\u7911 a B\u7897  Ng\'e2n Kh\u7889  Hoa K\u7923  ho\u7863 c Danh S\'e1ch Nh\u7919 ng T\u7893  Ch\u7913 c ho\u7863 c C\'e1 Nh\'e2n B\u7883  Kh\u432 \u7899 c T\u7915  c\u7911 a B\u7897  Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i Hoa K\u7923  ho\u7863 c b\u7845 t k\u7923  danh s\'e1ch \u273 \u7889 i t\u432 \u7907 ng b\u7883  h\u7841 n ch\u7871  n\'e0o kh\'e1c. B\u7857 ng vi\u7879 c t\u7843 i xu\u7889 ng v\'e0 s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, b\u7841 n cam k\u7871 t v\'e0 b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u7903  t\u7841 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  qu\u7889 c gia n\'e0o ho\u7863 c thu\u7897 c b\u7845 t k\u7923  danh s\'e1ch n\'e0o n\'eau tr\'ean. B\u7841 n c\u361 ng \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n s\u7869  kh\'f4ng s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple cho b\u7845 t k\u7923  m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch n\'e0o b\u7883  lu\u7853 t Hoa K\u7923  c\u7845 m, bao g\u7891 m v\'e0 kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u7903  vi\u7879 c ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n, thi\u7871 t k\u7871 , ch\u7871  t\u7841 o ho\u7863 c s\u7843 n xu\u7845 t t\'ean l\u7917 a, v\u361  kh\'ed h\u7841 t nh\'e2n, h\'f3a h\u7885 c ho\u7863 c sinh h\u7885 c.\
\

\f0\b 12. Kh\'f4ng Mi\uc0\u7877 n tr\u7915  Ho\u7863 c Chuy\u7875 n Giao.
\f1\b0  Vi\uc0\u7879 c tr\'ec ho\'e3n ho\u7863 c kh\'f4ng th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh \u273 \u7897 ng theo Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c xem l\'e0 m\u7897 t tuy\'ean b\u7889  mi\u7877 n tr\u7915  khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c quy \u273 \u7883 nh r\'f5 r\'e0ng b\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n v\'e0 \u273 \u432 \u7907 ck\'fd b\u7903 i m\u7897 t ng\u432 \u7901 i \u273 \u7841 i di\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u7911 y quy\u7873 n h\u7907 p ph\'e1p c\u7911 a Apple, v\'e0 kh\'f4ng m\u7897 t tuy\'ean b\u7889  mi\u7877 n tr\u7915  n\'e0o \u273 \u432 \u7907 c xem l\'e0 m\u7897 t tuy\'ean b\u7889  mi\u7877 n tr\u7915  li\'ean t\u7909 c ho\u7863 c tuy\'ean b\u7889  mi\u7877 n tr\u7915  cho c\'e1c tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p sau n\'e0y. B\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c chuy\u7875 n giao Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y, to\'e0n b\u7897  ho\u7863 c m\u7897 t ph\u7847 n, m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\'f3 s\u7921  ch\u7845 p thu\u7853 n tr\u432 \u7899 c b\u7857 ng v\u259 n b\u7843 n c\u7911 a Apple. B\u7845 t k\u7923  vi\u7879 c chuy\u7875 n giao kh\'f4ng ph\'f9 h\u7907 p n\'e0o \u273 \u7873 u s\u7869  b\u7883  coi l\'e0 v\'f4 hi\u7879 u. \
\

\f0\b 13. Ng\uc0\u432 \u7901 i D\'f9ng Cu\u7889 i L\'e0 Ch\'ednh Ph\u7911 .
\f1\b0  Ph\uc0\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 t\'e0i li\u7879 u li\'ean quan l\'e0 \'93S\u7843 n Ph\u7849 m Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i\'94, nh\u432  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 \u7883 nh ngh\u297 a t\u7841 i 48 C.F.R. \'a72.101, bao g\u7891 m \'93Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i\'94 v\'e0 \'93T\'e0i Li\u7879 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i\'94, nh\u432  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng t\u7841 i 48 C.F.R. \'a712.212 ho\u7863 c 48 C.F.R. \'a7227.7202, t\'f9y tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p \'e1p d\u7909 ng. Ph\'f9 h\u7907 p v\u7899 i quy \u273 \u7883 nh t\u7841 i 48 C.F.R. \'a712.212 ho\u7863 c 48 C.F.R. \'a7227.7202-1 \u273 \u7871 n 227.7202-4, t\'f9y tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p \'e1p d\u7909 ng, Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i v\'e0 T\'e0i Li\u7879 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng cho nh\u7919 ng ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng cu\u7889 i l\'e0 Ch\'ednh Ph\u7911  Hoa K\u7923  (a) ch\u7881  d\u432 \u7899 i h\'ecnh th\u7913 c l\'e0 S\u7843 n Ph\u7849 m Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i v\'e0 (b) ch\u7881  v\u7899 i c\'e1c quy\u7873 n nh\u432  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p cho t\u7845 t c\u7843  nh\u7919 ng ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng cu\u7889 i kh\'e1c theo c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n v\'e0 \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c n\'eau trong Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 nn\'e0y. C\'e1c quy\u7873 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'f4ng b\u7889  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c b\u7843 o l\u432 u theo lu\u7853 t b\u7843 n quy\u7873 n c\u7911 a Hoa K\u7923 .\
\

\f0\b 14. Ph\'e1p Lu\uc0\u7853 t \u272 i\u7873 u Ch\u7881 nh v\'e0 Hi\u7879 u L\u7921 c T\u7915 ng Ph\u7847 n.
\f1\b0  Tho\uc0\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh v\'e0 gi\u7843 i th\'edch theo lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a Ti\u7875 u Bang California, ngo\u7841 i tr\u7915  c\'e1c nguy\'ean t\u7855 c v\u7873  xung \u273 \u7897 t ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t. Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh theo C\'f4ng \u431 \u7899 c Li\'ean H\u7907 p Qu\u7889 c v\u7873  H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng Mua B\'e1n H\'e0ng H\'f3a Qu\u7889 c T\u7871 . Vi\u7879 c \'e1p d\u7909 ng C\'f4ng \u431 \u7899 c n\'e0y b\u7883  lo\u7841 i tr\u7915  r\'f5 r\'e0ng. N\u7871 u v\'ec m\u7897 t l\'fd do n\'e0o \u273 \'f3 m\'e0 t\'f2a \'e1n c\'f3 th\u7849 m quy\u7873 n th\u7845 y r\u7857 ng b\u7845 t k\u7923  quy \u273 \u7883 nh ho\u7863 c ph\u7847 n n\'e0o trong Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y kh\'f4ng th\u7875  th\u7921 c thi th\'ec ph\u7847 n c\'f2n l\u7841 i c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y v\u7851 n ti\u7871 p t\u7909 c c\'f3 hi\u7879 u l\u7921 c \u273 \u7847 y \u273 \u7911 .\
\

\f0\b 15. To\'e0n B\uc0\u7897  Tho\u7843  Thu\u7853 n; Ng\'f4n Ng\u7919  \u272 i\u7873 u Ch\u7881 nh
\f1\b0 . Tho\uc0\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y l\'e0 to\'e0n b\u7897  th\u7887 a thu\u7853 n gi\u7919 a b\u7841 n v\'e0 Apple li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 thay th\u7871  cho m\u7885 i th\u7887 a thu\u7853 n tr\u432 \u7899 c \u273 \'e2y ho\u7863 c hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh t\u7841 i Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y. B\u7845 t k\u7923  s\u7917 a \u273 \u7893 i ho\u7863 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nhn\'e0o c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883  r\'e0ng bu\u7897 c, tr\u7915  khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c l\u7853 p th\'e0nh v\u259 n b\u7843 n v\'e0 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c Apple k\'fd. Vi\u7879 c d\u7883 ch Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n \u273 \u7875  \u273 \'e1p \u7913 ng y\'eau c\u7847 u c\u7911 a qu\u7889 c gia s\u7903  t\u7841 i. Trong tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p c\'f3 m\'e2u thu\u7851 n gi\u7919 a b\u7843 n ti\u7871 ng Anh v\'e0 b\u7843 n kh\'f4ng ph\u7843 i b\u7857 ng ti\u7871 ng Anh, b\u7843 n ti\u7871 ng Anh c\u7911 a Tho\u7843  thu\u7853 n C\u7845 p quy\u7873 n n\'e0y s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u432 u ti\'ean \'e1p d\u7909 ng, trong ph\u7841 m vi kh\'f4ng b\u7883  c\u7845 m theo ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t t\u7841 i qu\u7889 c gia c\u7911 a b\u7841 n.\
\

\f0\b 16. X\'e1c Nh\uc0\u7853 n C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba.
\f1\b0  M\uc0\u7897 t s\u7889  th\'e0nh ph\u7847 n c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 c\'e1c ch\u432 \u417 ng tr\'ecnh ngu\u7891 n m\u7903  c\u7911 a b\'ean th\u7913  ba ch\u7913 a trong Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple c\'f3 th\u7875  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c Apple cung c\u7845 p tr\'ean trang web ngu\u7891 n m\u7903  c\u7911 a h\'e3ng ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://opensource.apple.com"}}{\fldrslt https://opensource.apple.com}}) (\'93Th\'e0nh Ph\uc0\u7847 n Ngu\u7891 n M\u7903 \'94). N\u7897 i dung x\'e1c nh\u7853 n, c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n v\'e0 tuy\'ean b\u7889  mi\u7877 n tr\u7915  d\'e0nh cho c\'e1c th\'e0nh ph\u7847 n \u273 \'f3 c\'f3 trong t\'e0i li\u7879 u \u273 i\u7879 n t\u7917  d\'e0nh cho Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple. Vui l\'f2ng tham kh\u7843 o t\'e0i li\u7879 u \u273 i\u7879 n t\u7917  v\'ec b\u7841 n c\'f3 th\u7875  c\'f3 th\'eam c\'e1c quy\u7873 n trong Th\'e0nh Ph\u7847 n Ngu\u7891 n M\u7903 . B\u7841 n x\'e1c nh\u7853 n r\'f5 r\'e0ng r\u7857 ng n\u7871 u ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng Apple b\u7883  h\u7887 ng ho\u7863 c t\u7893 n h\u7841 i do vi\u7879 c s\u7917 a \u273 \u7893 i Th\'e0nh Ph\u7847 n Ngu\u7891 n M\u7903  c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple th\'ec tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p h\u7887 ng h\'f3c ho\u7863 c t\u7893 n h\u7841 i n\'e0y s\u7869  b\u7883  lo\u7841 i tr\u7915  kh\u7887 i c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n b\u7843 o h\'e0nh ph\u7847 n c\u7913 ng c\u7911 a Apple. \
\
